  "body": "Perfectly positioned just a short stroll from the beach, cafés, restaurants and local shops, this is easy coastal living at its best. The Victor apartments boast award-winning architecture and are recognised for their contemporary design and community integration. \r\nThe west-facing aspect captures glorious afternoon sunshine, and a deck to unwind above mature trees, enjoying a peaceful outlook.\r\nThe primary suite features an ensuite, walk-through robe and direct access to the deck, while the second bedroom enjoys views towards Rangitoto Island and the channel.\r\nOn the first floor, a spacious, open common area to socialise with your neighbours. \r\nComplete with a secure car park and storage, this is the perfect lock-and-leave, investment or downsizer.\r\nAn as-new penthouse, in a prime location. A coastal lifestyle at The Victor.",
